1
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:11,080
According to friend Hung, what is most precious?

2
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:15,310
A. gold

3
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:20,600
B. rice grain

4
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:26,260
C. time

5
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:34,060
Answer B. Most precious is rice grain.

6
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:40,000
According to friend Lan, what is most precious?

7
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,150
A. gold

8
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:51,460
B. rice grain

9
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:56,020
C. time

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:05,370
Answer A. Most precious is gold.

11
00:01:05,370 --> 00:01:12,280
According to friend Nam, what is most precious?

12
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:18,220
A. gold

13
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:23,370
B. rice grain

14
00:01:23,370 --> 00:01:28,550
C. time

15
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:38,970
Answer C. Most precious is time.

16
00:01:38,970 --> 00:01:48,310
What is each friend's reason to defend their opinion?

17
00:01:49,820 --> 00:02:00,280
Hung: "Most precious is rice grain because rice grain feeds people".

18
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:16,330
Lan: "Most precious is gold because with gold there is money, with money can buy rice grain".

19
00:02:17,150 --> 00:02:28,800
Nam: "Most precious is time because with time can make rice grain gold silver".

20
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:47,880
Each friend's opinion has reason. What is teacher's opinion?

21
00:02:49,570 --> 00:03:02,080
Rice grain, gold, time are all very precious, but not most precious.

22
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:19,460
Most precious is worker. Workers make rice grain, gold silver. Workers do not let time pass in vain.

